===JSON_START===
{"bear": [{"title": {"ko": "2025년 적자 전환과 영업이익 감소", "en": "Return to losses in 2025 and lower operating profit"}, "body": {"ko": "2025년 지배주주 순이익은 880억원 순손실로 적자 전환했고, 영업이익은 2,985억원으로 전년 대비 27.6% 줄었다. 2023년에도 지배주주 순손실 1,334억원을 기록해 2022~2025년 동안 이익이 안정적으로 이어지지 않았다. 영업이익률도 2025년 5.6%로 2024년 7.3%보다 낮아졌다.", "en": "Net income attributable to controlling shareholders swung to an KRW 88 billion net loss in 2025, and operating profit fell 27.6% YoY to KRW 298.5 billion. A KRW 133.4 billion net loss in 2023 also means earnings did not stay steady across 2022 to 2025. The operating margin fell to 5.6% in 2025 from 7.3% in 2024."}}, {"title": {"ko": "석유화학 합작사 적자와 계약 종료 이후 과제", "en": "Joint venture losses and open questions after contract expiry"}, "body": {"ko": "2024년 보도에 따르면 DL케미칼의 합작사 여천NCC는 2022년부터 2,000억~3,000억원대 적자를 이어갔다. 합작 투자 계약 기간이 2024년 말 종료되며 처리 방안이 거론됐지만 당시 확정되지 않은 것으로 전해졌다. 같은 보도에서 COTC 설비 도입이 본격화하면 원가 경쟁력이 더 훼손될 수 있다는 전망도 나왔다.", "en": "A 2024 report said Yeochun NCC, the joint venture of DL Chemical, had posted losses of KRW 200 billion to KRW 300 billion a year since 2022. The joint venture contract was set to end at the close of 2024, and several options were discussed, but no decision was reported at that time. The same report cited a view that cost competitiveness could be further weakened as crude-oil-to-chemicals facilities come on line."}}, {"title": {"ko": "자회사 건설 원가 변동과 3분기 이익 감소", "en": "Construction cost swings and Q3 profit decline at a subsidiary"}, "body": {"ko": "DL이앤씨의 2026년 3분기 매출은 1조 5,065억원으로 전년 동기 대비 21.0% 줄었고, 영업이익은 1,073억원으로 8.1% 감소했다. 샤힌 프로젝트 공기 연장과 돌관공사에 따른 추가 비용이 총예정원가에 반영된 영향이다. 3분기 당기순손실은 267억원으로 흑자에서 적자로 전환했다(2026년 10월 30일 잠정 발표 기준).", "en": "DL E&C's Q3 2026 revenue fell 21.0% YoY to KRW 1.5065 trillion, and operating profit dropped 8.1% to KRW 107.3 billion. Additional costs from the Shahin project's schedule extension and accelerated construction were reflected in total estimated costs. The Q3 net loss of KRW 26.7 billion marked a switch from net profit a year earlier, according to the October 30, 2026 preliminary release."}}]}
===JSON_END===

069510-2bd77df3597ab6f561ea2a46.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bull": [{"title": {"ko": "영업이익률 개선 추세", "en": "Sustained margin improvement"}, "body": {"ko": "영업이익률은 2022년 1.9%에서 2025년 9.8%로 올랐고, 매출원가율도 같은 기간 85.63%에서 80.26%로 낮아졌다. 2025년 매출이 줄었는데도 영업이익이 458억원으로 늘어 원가와 비용 구조 개선이 반영된 결과로 읽힌다. 영업이익률 상승이 2023년부터 2025년까지 이어진 점이 강세 근거다.", "en": "Operating margin rose from 1.9% in 2022 to 9.8% in 2025, while the cost of sales ratio fell from 85.63% to 80.26% over the same period. Operating profit still rose to KRW 45.8 billion in 2025 even though revenue declined, which points to cost-structure gains. Margin expansion continuing from 2023 through 2025 is the core bullish evidence."}}, {"title": {"ko": "재무 체력 개선", "en": "Stronger balance sheet"}, "body": {"ko": "부채비율은 2024년 90.6%에서 2025년 46.9%로 낮아졌고 2025년 말 자본총계는 2,350억원이다. 2025년 영업활동 현금흐름은 2024년보다 줄었지만 지배주주 순이익을 웃도는 흐름은 이어졌다. 부채 부담이 줄고 현금 창출이 이익을 받쳐 주는 구조다.", "en": "The debt ratio fell from 90.6% in 2024 to 46.9% in 2025, and total equity at year-end 2025 was KRW 235 billion. Operating cash flow in 2025 was lower than in 2024 but still exceeded attributable net profit. Lower debt and cash generation that backs earnings form the financial base."}}, {"title": {"ko": "2026년 2분기 반등", "en": "Rebound in 2Q 2026"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 1분기 영업이익 53.2억원을 저점으로 2분기 125억원, 3분기 123억원으로 회복됐다. 3분기 영업이익은 전년 동기 대비 32.1% 늘었다. 분기 이익 수준이 저점 대비 높아진 것은 사업 흐름이 회복 방향에 있음을 보여준다.", "en": "Operating profit recovered from a KRW 5.32 billion low in 1Q 2026 to KRW 12.5 billion in 2Q and KRW 12.3 billion in 3Q. Third-quarter operating profit rose 32.1% year on year. Quarterly operating profit sitting well above the 1Q 2026 low indicates a recovery direction in operations."}}]}
===JSON_END===

215000-aa3bac6478b250cff9c1684b.text:
===JSON_START===
{"valuation_comment": {"ko": "시가총액은 자본총계보다 작아 순자산 대비 주가가 낮은 구간에 있고, 주가순자산비율(PBR)은 1배를 밑도는 수준이다. 이익 기준 배수는 실적 변동의 영향을 크게 받는다. 최근 네 개 분기 지배주주 순이익 합계가 26.7억원으로 작아, 적자와 흑자가 섞인 분기 손익이 수익 배수를 크게 흔드는 구조다. 배당 측면에서는 주가 조정에 따라 배당수익률 매력이 부각된다는 평가가 나왔다. 신한투자증권은 2026년 10월 23일 보고서에서 이 점을 짚으며 국내 사업 회복이 지연되는 상황에서도 해외 성장 가능성에 주목했다고 밝혔다. 신한투자증권은 같은 2026년 10월 23일 보고서에서 목표주가를 55,500원으로 낮춰 제시했다. 이 값은 증권사가 제시한 목표이며, 회사 가치에 대한 판단으로 읽히지 않도록 출처와 시점을 함께 확인할 필요가 있다.", "en": "Market capitalization sits below total equity, placing the stock at a level below book value per share, and the price-to-book ratio is under 1 times. Earnings-based multiples are highly sensitive to swings in profit. Profit attributable to controlling shareholders over the last four quarters totals KRW 2.67 billion, so quarters that alternate between losses and profits move earnings multiples sharply. On dividends, a securities firm noted in an October 23, 2026 report that the dividend yield has become more attractive after the share price decline, and it also pointed to overseas growth potential even as domestic recovery is delayed. Shinhan Investment Corp. set a lowered target price of KRW 55,500 in the same October 23, 2026 report. This is a target presented by the brokerage, dated October 2026, and it is not a view of this publication."}, "bull": [{"title": {"ko": "해외 비중 확대와 매장 기반", "en": "Overseas mix rising, store base expanding"}, "body": {"ko": "해외 매장 수는 2026년 3분기 말 4,641곳으로 전년 동기 대비 20.3% 늘었다. 신한투자증권은 2026년 연간 해외 매출 비중이 25.8%로 2025년보다 3%포인트 높아질 것으로 추정했다.", "en": "The overseas store count rose 20.3% year on year to 4,641 at the end of the third quarter of 2026. Shinhan Investment Corp. estimated the overseas share would reach 25.8% for 2026, up 3 percentage points from 2025."}}, {"title": {"ko": "분기 매출 증가세 전환", "en": "Quarterly revenue turns up"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 3분기 매출은 1,260억원으로 전년 동기 대비 4.3% 증가해 11개 분기 만에 증가세로 돌아섰다는 보도가 나왔다. 가맹점 대상 신제품 TwoVision NX Plus 업그레이드 판매 증가가 요인으로 공시됐다. 전 분기 대비로도 매출은 24.5% 늘었다. 다만 이익은 같은 흐름을 따르지 않았다.", "en": "Third-quarter 2026 revenue rose 4.3% year on year to KRW 126 billion, which press reports described as the first year-on-year increase in 11 quarters. The company attributed the increase to upgrade sales of the TwoVision NX Plus to franchise stores. Revenue also rose 24.5% from the previous quarter. Profit, however, did not follow the same path."}}, {"title": {"ko": "4분기 성수기 효과 전망", "en": "Fourth-quarter peak season outlook"}, "body": {"ko": "유진투자증권 박종선 연구원은 2026년 11월 2일 보고서에서 4분기 성수기 진입에 따라 해외 신규 제품 판매와 매장 운영 매출이 증가할 것으로 전망했다. 같은 보고서는 해외 사업이 실적 회복의 축이 될 수 있다는 점을 짚었다. 해외 매장 확대와 신제품 판매가 맞물리는지가 확인 지점이다.", "en": "Park Jong-seon of Eugene Investment & Securities said in a November 2, 2026 report that overseas new-product sales and store-operation revenue should rise as the fourth-quarter peak season begins. The same report pointed to overseas operations as a possible axis of earnings recovery. Whether store expansion and new-product sales move together is the point to watch."}}]}
===JSON_END===

001460-a0268c6d19d0a36f9818847e.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bull": [{"title": {"ko": "임대 기반의 이익 구조", "en": "Leasing-based profit structure"}, "body": {"ko": "투자부동산 공정가치는 1조 2,780억원으로 보도됐다. 본업 매출이 줄어든 상황에서도 임대 자산이 이익을 받치는 구조라는 점이 강세 근거로 거론된다.", "en": "Investment property at fair value was reported at KRW 1.278 trillion. The argument for strength is that leasing assets support profit even as core apparel revenue declines."}}, {"title": {"ko": "현금 창출력과 이익 회복", "en": "Cash generation and earnings recovery"}, "body": {"ko": "영업활동 현금흐름은 2022년 105억원에서 2023년 303억원, 2025년 342억원으로 늘었다. 같은 기간 영업이익률은 14.9%(2022년)에서 16.3%(2025년)로 올랐다. 2025년 지배주주 순이익은 196억원으로 2024년보다 6.4% 늘어 이익 회복 방향이 확인됐다.", "en": "Operating cash flow rose from KRW 10.5 billion in 2022 to KRW 30.3 billion in 2023 and KRW 34.2 billion in 2025. Over the same span, operating margin improved from 14.9% in 2022 to 16.3% in 2025. Net profit attributable to controlling shareholders rose 6.4% to KRW 19.6 billion in 2025, pointing to an earnings recovery."}}, {"title": {"ko": "주주환원 조치", "en": "Shareholder return measures"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 8월 5일 이사회가 결의한 자기주식 취득 신탁계약은 30억원 규모다. 계약기간은 2026년 8월 6일부터 2027년 2월 5일까지이며, 목적은 주가 안정과 기업가치 제고다. 신탁계약 체결 전 회사는 보통주 지분율 2.19%, 기타주식 지분율 4.75%의 자기주식을 보유하고 있었다.", "en": "The treasury share trust contract approved by the board on August 5, 2026 is worth KRW 3 billion. It runs from August 6, 2026 to February 5, 2027, with share price stability and enhanced corporate value as its stated purpose. Before the contract, the company held treasury shares equal to 2.19% of common shares and 4.75% of other shares."}}]}
===JSON_END===

093920-46bc08dd0069b4df517e12b1.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bull": [{"title": {"ko": "재무 여력과 낮은 부채", "en": "Financial capacity and low leverage"}, "body": {"ko": "2025년 말 자본총계는 2,172억원이고 그중 지배주주 지분은 2,144억원이다. 부채총계는 326억원이며 부채비율은 2022년 20.9%에서 2025년 15.0%로 낮은 수준을 유지했다. 차입 의존도가 낮은 구조여서 매출 감소기에도 재무 충격이 제한적이다.", "en": "Total equity at the end of 2025 was KRW 217.2 billion, of which KRW 214.4 billion belonged to controlling shareholders. Total liabilities were KRW 32.6 billion, and the debt-to-equity ratio held at a low level, moving from 20.9% in 2022 to 15.0% in 2025. Low reliance on borrowing limits financial strain even while sales were declining."}}, {"title": {"ko": "2026년 분기 매출 반등", "en": "Sales rebound in 2026 quarters"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 1분기 매출 365억원 이후 2분기 437억원, 3분기 470억원으로 두 분기 연속 늘었다. 1분기에는 영업이익 10.1억원으로 흑자 전환했고 2분기 영업이익은 12.5억원으로 전 분기 대비 23.2% 늘었다. 3분기 매출 회복이 이익 개선으로 이어질지가 강세 근거의 핵심이다.", "en": "After KRW 36.5 billion in the first quarter of 2026, revenue rose to KRW 43.7 billion in the second quarter and KRW 47 billion in the third, a two-quarter rise. Operating profit turned positive at KRW 1.01 billion in the first quarter, and the second quarter's KRW 1.25 billion was up 23.2% from the prior quarter. Whether the third-quarter sales recovery carries into profit is the core of the bullish case."}}, {"title": {"ko": "주주환원과 자율공시", "en": "Shareholder returns and voluntary disclosure"}, "body": {"ko": "배당수익률은 업종 평균을 크게 웃도는 편으로, 주주환원 측면이 두드러진다. 정기 실적 공시가 2026년 3분기까지 주기적으로 이어져 공시 흐름은 유지되고 있다.", "en": "Its dividend yield is well above the industry average, which makes shareholder returns a notable feature. Periodic regular earnings filings have continued through the third quarter of 2026."}}]}
===JSON_END===

289080-e51dcac766f2950a53f90205.text:
===JSON_START===
{"0": "Annual revenue was 254 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2023, 297 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2024 (up 17.3% year on year), 211 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2025 (down 29.2% year on year), and 214 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2026 (up 1.7% year on year). The largest year in the period was the fiscal year ended March 2024, and the smallest was the fiscal year ended March 2025. Operating profit rose to 45.4 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2023 and 63.3 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2024 (up 39.6% year on year), but it swung to an operating loss of 60.5 hundred million won in the fiscal year ended March 2025. The operating loss for the fiscal year ended March 2026 was 27.2 hundred million won, so the losses continued, but the size of the loss narrowed. The operating margin moved as 17.9%, 21.3%, -28.7%, and -12.7%. Net profit attributable to owners of the parent was 42.9 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2024, turned into a net loss attributable to owners of the parent of 52.3 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2025, and then narrowed to a net loss attributable to owners of the parent of 10 hundred million won for the fiscal year ended March 2026. Net income including non-controlling interests for the same years was 34.5 hundred million won, 42.9 hundred million won, a net loss of 52.3 hundred million won, and a net loss of 10 hundred million won. Cash flow from operating activities was negative in all four fiscal years, from the fiscal year ended March 2023 through the fiscal year ended March 2026. The debt-to-equity ratio rose from 10.3% to 32.6%, and as of the end of March 2026, total equity was 699 hundred million won and total liabilities were 228 hundred million won. For the fiscal 2025 results, an external analysis site cited decreases in investment partnership income, decreases in partnership management fees, and a reduction in equity-method gains from partnerships as the main causes. On a quarterly basis, revenue increased for four consecutive quarters, from 43.2 hundred million won in Q3 2025 to 45.9 hundred million won in Q4 2025, 60 hundred million won in Q1 2026, 91.5 hundred million won in Q2 2026, and 97 hundred million won in Q3 2026. Operating profit went from an operating loss of 14.4 hundred million won in Q4 2025 to a return to profit with an operating profit of 3.3 hundred million won in Q1 2026, and continued with 15.7 hundred million won in Q2 and 11 hundred million won in Q3 (down 29.8% quarter on quarter). The sum of net profit attributable to owners of the parent over the latest four quarters (Q4 2025 to Q3 2026) is 6.4 hundred million won. The swings in quarterly earnings stem from a structure in which partnership income moves with the timing of investment valuations and exits."}
===JSON_END===

068930-90208ebfeb1065660c748376.text:
===JSON_START===
{"valuation_comment": {"ko": "현재 배수는 주가에 따라 매일 바뀌므로, 이익 규모와 장부 가치에 대한 상대 위치로 보는 것이 적절하다. 최근 네 개 분기 지배주주 순이익 합계는 422억원이며, 2025년 말 지배주주 지분은 1,383억원이다. 시가총액이 장부상 지배주주 지분을 웃도는 구간에 있어 순자산 대비 프리미엄이 붙은 상태다. 흥국증권은 2026년 3분기 실적 발표 직후 리포트에서 실적 규모가 커졌음에도 시가총액은 과거 평균 수준에 머물러 있다고 분석하고, 밸류에이션 재평가 여력이 있다고 판단했다. 흥국증권은 2026년 3분기 실적 발표 직후 리포트에서 목표주가를 1만 3,000원으로 상향했다. 주주환원 측면에서는 2025 사업연도 배당 총액 133억원과 배당성향 63.8%가 확인된다. 회사가 2025~2028년 지배주주 순이익의 최소 50% 이상을 환원하겠다고 밝힌 점도 배당 기반의 참고 사항이다. 2024년 이후 영업이익이 회복되면서 이익 기준의 밸류에이션 비교 구간은 2024년 저점 시기와 달라졌다.", "en": "Current multiples change daily with the share price, so it is more useful to read them against earnings scale and book value. Controlling-shareholder net income over the last four quarters totaled KRW 42.2 billion, and controlling-shareholder equity at the end of 2025 was KRW 138.3 billion. Market capitalization sits above book value attributable to controlling shareholders, which means the shares trade at a premium to net asset value. In a report issued right after the third-quarter 2026 results, Heungkuk Securities said market capitalization has stayed near its past average even as earnings scale has grown, and it judged that there is room for a revaluation. In that same report, issued right after the third-quarter 2026 results, Heungkuk Securities raised its target price to KRW 13,000. On shareholder returns, the fiscal 2025 cash dividend totaled KRW 13.3 billion, a payout ratio of 63.8%, and the company has pledged to return at least half of controlling-shareholder net income over 2025 to 2028. Because operating profit recovered after its 2024 low, the earnings base used for valuation comparisons has shifted relative to that period."}, "bear": [{"title": {"ko": "학령인구 감소의 구조적 부담", "en": "Structural pressure from a shrinking school-age population"}, "body": {"ko": "교육 업종 전반에서는 학령인구 감소가 장기 성장의 제약이라는 우려가 강하다는 보도가 있다. 회사의 실적 성장은 1등 브랜드로의 수요 집중을 전제로 하므로, 수험생 수가 줄어드는 국면에서 집중 효과가 얼마나 이어지는지가 확인 지점이다. 상위권 대학 정원 고정이라는 회사 논리는 이 우려에 대한 반론이지만, 수요 구조가 바뀌는 사례는 실적으로 확인해야 한다.", "en": "Press coverage notes that concern about the shrinking school-age population as a long-term constraint remains strong across the education sector. The company's growth depends on demand concentrating in leading brands, so whether that concentration holds as the pool of test-takers shrinks is the open question. The company's argument that top-tier university seats are fixed answers this concern, but any shift in demand must be confirmed in reported results."}}, {"title": {"ko": "분기 변동성과 일회성 이익", "en": "Quarterly volatility and one-time gains"}, "body": {"ko": "2025년 4분기에는 영업손실 49.2억원과 지배주주 순손실 34.1억원으로 적자 전환했다. 2026년 2분기 지배주주 순이익 183억원에는 베트남 합작법인 지분 매각에 따른 처분이익이 더해졌다고 회사가 밝혔다. 이런 요인을 제외한 분기별 이익 흐름이 얼마나 안정적인지는 아직 짧은 기간의 데이터로만 확인된다.", "en": "The fourth quarter of 2025 swung to an operating loss of KRW 4.92 billion and a controlling-shareholder net loss of KRW 3.41 billion. The company said the second-quarter 2026 controlling-shareholder net income of KRW 18.3 billion included a gain on the sale of its Vietnam joint venture stake. How stable quarterly profit is excluding such items can only be seen over the short period reported so far."}}, {"title": {"ko": "부채 부담과 자본 배분", "en": "Debt burden and capital allocation"}, "body": {"ko": "2025년 말 부채총계는 1,755억원으로 자본총계 1,705억원을 웃돈다. 부채비율은 2024년 109.8%에서 2025년 102.9%로 낮아졌지만 2022년 48.6%, 2023년 46.7%보다 여전히 높은 수준이다. 주주환원과 자사주 매입이 확대되는 국면에서 재무 여력이 이를 감당할 수 있는지가 함께 확인돼야 한다.", "en": "Total liabilities at the end of 2025 were KRW 175.5 billion, above total equity of KRW 170.5 billion. The debt-to-equity ratio fell from 109.8% in 2024 to 102.9% in 2025 but remains well above the 48.6% in 2022 and 46.7% in 2023. As buybacks and dividends expand, whether financial capacity can support them needs to be confirmed."}}], "bull": [{"title": {"ko": "고등 부문 영업 레버리지", "en": "Operating leverage in the high-school unit"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 3분기 누적 영업이익 잠정치는 527억원으로 2025년 연간 영업이익 316억원을 넘어섰다고 2026년 11월 4일 공시됐다. 회사는 대성마이맥 3분기 누적 영업이익이 전년 동기 대비 두 배로 늘었다고 밝혔고, 기존 플랫폼과 콘텐츠를 활용한 매출 확대가 수익성 개선으로 이어졌다고 설명했다. 고정비 부담이 낮아진 구조에서 추가 매출이 이익으로 연결되는 흐름이 이익률 회복의 근거다.", "en": "The preliminary operating profit for the first nine months of 2026 was KRW 52.7 billion, already above the full-year 2025 figure of KRW 31.6 billion, according to a November 4, 2026 filing. The company said operating profit from its leading online lecture brand doubled year on year over the first nine months. Its explanation is that added revenue on an existing platform is flowing through to profit, which is the basis for the margin recovery."}}, {"title": {"ko": "주주환원 정책 확대", "en": "Expanding shareholder-return policy"}, "body": {"ko": "2025~2028년 4개년 정책으로 지배주주 순이익의 최소 50% 이상을 환원하겠다는 방침이 공표돼 있다. 2025 사업연도 현금배당 총액은 133억원으로 배당성향은 63.8%였으며, 고배당기업 요건을 충족했다. 2026년에는 자사주 62만 7,972주를 소각했고, 100억원 규모의 자사주 매입을 추가로 진행하고 있다.", "en": "The company has a stated policy to return at least 50% of controlling-shareholder net income over 2025 to 2028. The fiscal 2025 cash dividend totaled KRW 13.3 billion, a 63.8% payout ratio that met the requirements for a high-dividend company. In 2026 it retired 627,972 treasury shares and is buying back KRW 10 billion in additional shares."}}, {"title": {"ko": "입시 개편 국면의 브랜드 수요", "en": "Brand demand during admissions reform"}, "body": {"ko": "N수생 수요 확대가 이 브랜드 판매의 기반이 된다는 것이 회사의 설명이다. 2028 대성패스는 10월부터 판매 중이며 판매 호조를 보인다고 회사가 밝혔다. 입시 제도 변화기에 검증된 브랜드와 콘텐츠의 경쟁력이 부각된다는 것이 회사의 논리다.", "en": "The company explains that expanding demand from repeat test-takers underpins sales of this brand. The company reports that its 2028 Daesung Pass has been selling well since October. Its argument is that proven brands and content gain prominence during periods of admissions change."}}]}
===JSON_END===

006090-9c9f1eeb60cc3bd0b9167985.text:
===JSON_START===
{"0": "Annual revenue was KRW 3,691 eok (1 eok = KRW 100 million) in 2022, KRW 3,915 eok in 2023 (up 6.1% year over year), KRW 4,007 eok in 2024 (up 2.3% year over year), and KRW 4,174 eok in 2025 (up 4.2% year over year), so it rose for three consecutive years from 2023 to 2025, and 2025 was the largest year in the period. Operating profit rose from KRW 102 eok in 2022 to KRW 163 eok in 2023 (up 59.6% year over year) and KRW 209 eok in 2024 (up 28.4% year over year), making 2024 the largest year in the period. Operating profit in 2025 fell to KRW 135 eok (down 35.3% year over year). The operating margin rose from 2.8% in 2022 to 4.2% in 2023 and 5.2% in 2024, then fell to 3.2% in 2025. Taken together with media reports that the cost of sales ratio reached 89.6% in the same year, the 2025 pattern of rising revenue but a falling margin suggests that cost pressure may have been a major factor. Net profit attributable to controlling shareholders peaked at KRW 203 eok in 2023 (up 138.1% year over year) from KRW 85.3 eok in 2022, then declined for two consecutive years, to KRW 126 eok in 2024 (down 37.7% year over year) and KRW 106 eok in 2025 (down 16.3% year over year). In 2023, net profit attributable to controlling shareholders was markedly larger than operating profit, so factors outside operating profit, such as non-operating gains and losses, may have played a role. Cash flow from operating activities rose from KRW -162 eok in 2022 to KRW 296 eok in 2023 and KRW 493 eok in 2024, then fell to KRW 117 eok in 2025. At the end of 2025, total equity was KRW 2,472 eok, of which equity attributable to controlling shareholders was also KRW 2,472 eok, and total liabilities were KRW 1,891 eok. On a quarterly basis, third-quarter 2025 revenue was KRW 1,096 eok and operating profit was KRW 36.5 eok, while in the fourth quarter of 2025 revenue fell sharply to KRW 1,040 eok (down 5.1% quarter over quarter) and operating profit to KRW 2.1 eok (down 94.2% quarter over quarter). In the first quarter of 2026 the company recovered, with revenue of KRW 1,052 eok, operating profit of KRW 69.5 eok (up 3,159.6% quarter over quarter), and net profit attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 47 eok, but in the second quarter it fell again, with revenue of KRW 921 eok (down 12.5% quarter over quarter) and operating profit of KRW 4.8 eok (down 93.2% quarter over quarter). Operating profit in the third quarter of 2026 was KRW 24.8 eok (up 421.5% quarter over quarter and down 32.0% year over year), and, unlike the same period a year earlier when net profit attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 14.7 eok, it swung to a net loss of KRW 7.6 eok. The sum of net profit attributable to controlling shareholders over the most recent four quarters (fourth quarter of 2025 to third quarter of 2026) is KRW 78.8 eok."}
===JSON_END===

068240-3b14e6e441750bf47e02e5d5.text:
===JSON_START===
{"0": "Based on reported results, revenue was KRW 209.2 billion in 2022, KRW 357.8 billion in 2023 (up 71.1% year on year), KRW 301.5 billion in 2024 (down 15.7% year on year), and KRW 112.1 billion in 2025 (down 62.8% year on year). Revenue peaked in 2023 and fell for two consecutive years from 2024 to 2025, with 2023 the largest year and 2025 the smallest year between 2022 and 2025. Operating profit moved from an operating loss of KRW 159.3 billion in 2022 to an operating profit of KRW 19.3 billion in 2023 (a turnaround to profit from the previous year) and an operating profit of KRW 7.65 billion in 2024 (down 60.3% year on year), then swung to an operating loss of KRW 120.7 billion in 2025 (a turnaround to loss from the previous year). The operating margin was -76.1% in 2022, 5.4% in 2023, 2.5% in 2024, and -107.7% in 2025. The widening of the loss in 2025 is attributed to lower railcar revenue, greater raw material price volatility, and cost burdens from global supply chain disruptions (WiseReport). Net income attributable to controlling shareholders was positive at KRW 3.71 billion in 2023 and KRW 11.3 billion in 2024, but turned to a net loss attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 197.0 billion in 2025. Net loss including non-controlling interests was KRW 196.9 billion in 2025, a different figure from the net income attributable to controlling shareholders. Operating cash flow was negative in all four years: -KRW 149.5 billion in 2022, -KRW 2.69 billion in 2023, -KRW 50.9 billion in 2024, and -KRW 82.2 billion in 2025. On a quarterly basis, revenue fell from KRW 28.0 billion in Q3 2025 to KRW 4.66 billion in Q4, then rose to KRW 21.0 billion in Q1 2026, and in Q3 it was KRW 10.6 billion, down 62.0% year on year (there is no data for Q2 revenue). The operating loss was KRW 19.3 billion in Q3 2025, KRW 63.1 billion in Q4, KRW 9.46 billion in Q1 2026, KRW 22.9 billion in Q2, and KRW 4.7 billion in Q3. Net income attributable to controlling shareholders was a profit of KRW 34.1 billion in Q1 2026, but the compiled data shows a pre-tax loss of KRW 15.2 billion excluding certain items, suggesting that the Q1 profit was largely driven by one-off factors (Google Finance compilation). Net losses attributable to controlling shareholders followed, at KRW 25.0 billion in Q2 and KRW 19.7 billion in Q3, and the total net loss attributable to controlling shareholders over the most recent four quarters (Q4 2025 to Q3 2026) is KRW 149.5 billion."}
===JSON_END===

005990-c6172452eac26190c4f2f196.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bear": [{"title": {"ko": "연간 영업이익 2년 연속 감소", "en": "Two straight years of lower annual operating profit"}, "body": {"ko": "영업이익은 2023년 822억원에서 2024년 783억원(전년 대비 4.8% 감소), 2025년 640억원(전년 대비 18.3% 감소)으로 줄었다. 영업이익률도 2025년 2.9%로 2022년 이후 가장 낮다. 매출이 2025년까지 3년 연속 늘었지만 증가율은 0.3%에 그쳐, 외형 성장이 이익으로 이어지지 않았다.", "en": "Operating profit fell from KRW 82.2 billion in 2023 to KRW 78.3 billion in 2024 and KRW 64 billion in 2025, with operating margin at 2.9% in 2025. Revenue grew only 0.3% in 2025, so top-line growth did not carry through to profit."}}, {"title": {"ko": "핵심 자회사의 구조적 압박", "en": "Structural pressure at the core subsidiary"}, "body": {"ko": "데이터 사이트 요약에 따르면 매일유업의 유가공 영업이익은 559억원에서 396억원으로 줄었다. 출산율 감소, 식물성 음료 확산, 원유 단가 상승이 겹친 결과로 제시됐다. 외식 자회사 영업이익도 73억원에서 44억원으로 감소했다. 자회사 한두 곳의 부진이 지배주주 이익 전체에 직접 반영되는 구조다.", "en": "A third-party summary reports that Maeil Dairies' dairy operating profit fell from KRW 55.9 billion to KRW 39.6 billion, citing falling birth rates, plant-based beverages and higher raw milk prices. Food-service operating profit reportedly fell from KRW 7.3 billion to KRW 4.4 billion. Weakness at one or two subsidiaries flows directly into controlling-shareholder earnings."}}, {"title": {"ko": "지배주주 이익의 변동성", "en": "Volatility in controlling-shareholder earnings"}, "body": {"ko": "지배주주 순이익은 2024년 242억원으로 전년 대비 51.3% 줄었다가 2025년 325억원으로 회복했다. 2026년 1분기 66.3억원은 전 분기 대비 49.6% 줄었고, 3분기 69.3억원은 전년 동기 대비 25.9% 줄었다. 영업이익이 늘어도 지배주주 이익과 현금 창출이 같은 방향으로 움직이지 않는다.", "en": "Profit attributable to controlling shareholders fell 51.3% in 2024 before recovering to KRW 32.5 billion in 2025. The first quarter of 2026 fell 49.6% from the prior quarter, and the third quarter was down 25.9% year on year."}}]}
===JSON_END===

000520-8c88eefdcfa515bc0f6dfc86.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bull": [{"title": {"ko": "분기 적자 폭 축소 흐름", "en": "Quarterly losses keep narrowing"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 1분기부터 3분기까지 분기 영업손실은 전 분기 대비 줄었고, 3분기 영업손실은 31.9억원이다. 2026년 3분기 지배주주 순손실은 64억원으로 2025년 3분기 79.3억원보다 작다. 적자가 이어지고 있지만 손실 규모는 분기마다 축소되는 방향이다.", "en": "Quarterly operating losses narrowed from the first quarter through the third quarter of 2026 compared with the prior quarter, and the third-quarter loss was KRW 3.19 billion. The third-quarter net loss attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 6.4 billion, smaller than KRW 7.93 billion a year earlier. The losses continue, but their size has narrowed in each quarter."}}, {"title": {"ko": "아필리부 판매 재개와 별도 기준 전망", "en": "Afilibu sales resume with a standalone outlook"}, "body": {"ko": "SK증권은 아필리부 판매 재개 첫 달 매출이 15억원을 넘었다고 짚었다. 같은 보고서는 2026년 별도 기준 매출 2,394억원, 영업이익 113억원을 제시했다. 이는 2026년 2월 보고서의 추정이며, 증권사가 제시한 회복 시나리오로 읽힌다.", "en": "SK Securities pointed out that first-month sales after Afilibu's resumption exceeded KRW 1.5 billion. The same report presented a 2026 standalone revenue estimate of KRW 239.4 billion and operating profit of KRW 11.3 billion. This is a February 2026 brokerage estimate and reads as the brokerage's recovery scenario."}}, {"title": {"ko": "베트남 CMO와 수출 협의 확대", "en": "Vietnam CMO and export talks expand"}, "body": {"ko": "협의 상대는 유럽·일본·북미 안과 제약사이며, 이 협의가 실제 위탁생산 계약으로 이어지는지가 다음 확인 지점이다. 일부 해외 제약사와는 텀시트 작성을 마쳤고 연내 추가 계약을 기대한다고 말했다. 리마딘정의 아시아 수출도 협의가 구체화되는 단계다.", "en": "The counterparties are eye-care pharmaceutical firms in Europe, Japan and North America, and whether these talks turn into actual contract manufacturing agreements is the next point to check. It said term sheets had been completed with some overseas firms and it expected additional CMO contracts within the year. Export talks for Limadin tablets in Asia have also become more concrete."}}]}
===JSON_END===

038540-e153bcd130a96dde33b50675.text:
===JSON_START===
{"keypoints": [{"ko": "2025년 매출은 4,186억원으로 전년 대비 51.9% 감소했다. 2023년 정점 이후 2024년부터 2025년까지 2년 연속 감소했다.", "en": "Revenue in 2025 was KRW 418.6 billion, down 51.9% from the prior year. It has declined for two consecutive years since the 2023 peak."}, {"ko": "영업손실은 2024년 2,148억원에서 2025년 482억원으로 줄었으나, 2023년부터 2025년까지 3년 연속 적자다.", "en": "The operating loss narrowed from KRW 214.8 billion in 2024 to KRW 48.2 billion in 2025, but the company has now recorded three consecutive years of losses from 2023 to 2025."}, {"ko": "2026년 2분기 영업손실 45.2억원, 3분기 영업손실 30.7억원으로 적자 폭이 축소됐다.", "en": "The operating loss narrowed to KRW 4.52 billion in Q2 2026 and KRW 3.07 billion in Q3 2026."}, {"ko": "자회사 상상인증권(지분 57%)은 2026년 3분기 누적 순이익 148억원으로, 2025년 같은 기간 순손실 42억원에서 흑자 전환했다고 2026년 11월 16일 공시했다.", "en": "Subsidiary SANGSANGIN INVESTMENT&SECURITIES, 57% owned, reported cumulative net income of KRW 14.8 billion for the first three quarters of 2026, turning from a net loss of KRW 4.2 billion a year earlier, according to its November 16, 2026 disclosure."}, {"ko": "회사는 2026년 10월 공시한 기업가치 제고 계획에서 2028 회계연도 PBR 0.70배를 중장기 목표로 제시했다.", "en": "In its value-up plan disclosed in October 2026, the company set a medium-term target of a 0.70x price-to-book ratio for fiscal 2028."}], "bear": [{"title": {"ko": "연속 적자와 재무 부담", "en": "Consecutive Losses and Financial Burden"}, "body": {"ko": "2023년부터 2025년까지 3년 연속 적자가 이어졌고, 2025년 말 지배주주 지분은 3,828억원인 반면 부채총계는 4조 507억원이다. 부채비율은 2022년 642.2%에서 2025년 867.2%로 올랐다. 2026년 2분기와 3분기에도 지배주주 순손실이 이어져 최근 4개 분기 순손실 합계는 685억원이다.", "en": "The company recorded three consecutive years of losses from 2023 to 2025. At the end of 2025, equity attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 382.8 billion against total liabilities of KRW 4.05 trillion. The debt-to-equity ratio rose from 642.2% in 2022 to 867.2% in 2025. Net losses attributable to controlling shareholders continued in Q2 and Q3 2026, bringing the last four quarters to KRW 68.5 billion."}}, {"title": {"ko": "매출 축소 흐름", "en": "Shrinking Revenue"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 3분기 매출은 977억원으로 전 분기 대비 22.5% 감소했고 전년 동기 대비로는 36.4% 감소했다. 2026년 1분기 정점 이후 2개 분기 연속 감소가 이어지고 있다.", "en": "Q3 2026 revenue of KRW 97.7 billion fell 22.5% from the prior quarter and 36.4% from a year earlier. Revenue has declined for two consecutive quarters since the Q1 2026 peak."}}, {"title": {"ko": "계열사 매각 지연과 지배구조", "en": "Delayed Affiliate Disposals and Governance"}, "body": {"ko": "회사는 주가순자산비율이 낮은 원인으로 계열사 매각 지연을 공시에서 꼽았다. 상상인인더스트리 지분 매각은 2025년 3월 결정됐으나 3년 안에 재매입할 수 있는 콜옵션이 계약에 포함됐다. 최대주주 등 특수관계인 지분이 2026년 7월 기준 33.42%로 높아 유통 가능 주식 비중이 제한된 구조다.", "en": "The company cited delayed affiliate disposals in its disclosure as a reason for its low price-to-book ratio. A stake in Sangsangin Industry was set for sale in March 2025, but the agreement includes a call option allowing repurchase within three years. Related parties including the largest shareholder held 33.42% as of July 2026, which limits the free float."}}]}
===JSON_END===

453450-10338d59242d5c13a3d63ee1.text:
===JSON_START===
{"0": "Annual revenue fell 5.5% year over year, from KRW 1,319 hundred million in 2023 to KRW 1,247 hundred million in 2024, and then rose 0.7% year over year to KRW 1,256 hundred million in 2025. Among 2023-2025, the largest year was 2023 and the smallest was 2024. Operating profit of KRW 15.9 hundred million in 2023 turned into an operating loss of KRW 43.4 hundred million in 2024, and then returned to an operating profit of KRW 8.2 hundred million in 2025. The operating margin was 1.2% in 2023, -3.5% in 2024, and 0.6% in 2025. Net profit attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 43.1 hundred million in 2023, a net loss attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 30.1 hundred million in 2024, and a net profit attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 21.4 hundred million in 2025. Net profit including non-controlling interests was KRW 41.6 hundred million in 2023, a net loss of KRW 27.9 hundred million in 2024, and a net profit of KRW 20.2 hundred million in 2025, which differs from net profit attributable to controlling shareholders. The press cited cost efficiency and business structure improvement as the background to the 2025 profitability recovery. Cash flow from operating activities was KRW 25.9 hundred million in 2023, KRW 25.3 hundred million in 2024, and KRW 54 hundred million in 2025. On a quarterly basis, Q3 2025 revenue was KRW 427 hundred million, operating profit was KRW 33.4 hundred million, and net profit attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 78.3 hundred million, but in Q4 the company swung to revenue of KRW 347 hundred million (down 18.8% quarter over quarter), an operating loss of KRW 6 hundred million, and a net loss attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 44 hundred million. After Q1 2026 revenue of KRW 206 hundred million (down 40.5% quarter over quarter), an operating loss of KRW 22 hundred million, and a net loss attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 13 hundred million, the losses narrowed in Q2 to revenue of KRW 209 hundred million, an operating loss of KRW 16.5 hundred million, and a net loss attributable to controlling shareholders of KRW 9.5 hundred million. Q3 2026 revenue is KRW 382 hundred million (up 83.4% quarter over quarter and down 10.4% year over year), operating profit is KRW 30.9 hundred million (a return to profit from the previous quarter and down 7.5% year over year), and net profit attributable to controlling shareholders is KRW 22.5 hundred million (down 71.3% year over year). The key to the profit recovery is that operating profit returned to positive as revenue rose for two consecutive quarters from the Q1 low."}
===JSON_END===

